  "bookId": "2CH",
  "reference": "2 Damanyoojiga 28",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahasi was sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasi abeeda gaba gweanyeew diktam damanda ang'eada gheambalmeedean, hean goombaliischi gweanyeew damwalah aba Yerusalemu. Hean ak ea masina ng'asheega doobiiweadi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, gawuurji ghweandaanyi was Dawdi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niny ghwaat naweadinga sugoodiga Israeli. Hean gwasissa Baali sanaamajeega; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghaghwarda geediga ng'andidi aba moangoachiyda orjeeda Hinomu. Ak ghaghwarda orjoagaaschi ghoah haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi, gawuurji munyinda sina eemoojiga ghayi hoan NG'UTAMIIDA aba madeeda fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoadayda lukghumajeega nea ghaghwarda geediga ng'andidi aba heetiyeada, ea aba iheenga heayeeniga, ea usheaka geediga seenga nyawiiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'ucheeda fuga Shaamu ea Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwayiin NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANYI jeeda geatinga sugoocheanda Shaamu, ak geajoar ak ghwaat ghoah giing'oonyanga fugaaschi saang'a ak ghwaat ea ghoahiita Dameski. Nea eara aba damandida geahaak geatinga sugoocheanda Israeli was dea joar niny aba miyeeda haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Beka was orjeeda Remaliya ghabwar fih sagalamnyooji bughala ea diktam eaweecheanjagi aba Yuda, nea ea fuga meanyi gil, aba gideaba nijakta saawa NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA ghweaniga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Sikri, was siida haw uur bea Efraimu, ghabwar Maaseya was orjeeda sugoocheanda ea Asrikamu was shirikarajeanda haw miineadaysa gheeda, ea Elikana duukusa sugoocheanda aba hawunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga Israeli ghoang'waayi giing'oonyan sagalamnyooji bughalaji iyeenya bea fuga ooduupcheewi was gadeemga, ea orjooga, ea haweega; aba ng'ata ghwaat easanga saang'a aba heeda nyaawa ak ghwaat easanga Samariya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sibaneeda siguura Odedi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda ashoohoocheanda NG'UTAMIIDA gwanda hoowa, nea gheawungaaschi geeguura Odedi; hean ghang'eat gawa gwaroonyi shirikareeda leabu Samariya, ak gwayeesha saawa, “Ang'ula, gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA ghweanigeagwa gwanyareeksa fuga Yuda, ak ea niyiin saawa geatingeagwa, ak ea noabwarji aba nyarasta ak ghamneawa ea nihita humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa ea noogasayi oombala fuga Yuda ea gea Yerusalemu, headiga ea gadeemga ak ghoanung' ghoah fugeagwa bea gadiyeeda. Agooga nea goobea geat miy asina riing'eeda aba badayda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa ooleeysean iita, ak ghoatealdi giing'oonyanga was fuga ooduupcheewi ghayi oong'oanyi, aba gideaba nyarasta NG'UTAMIIDA gwanda badahuukeagwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghang'eatng'eat fiisu hees bea gheeh Efraimu was Asariya bea Yohanani, ea Berekiya bea Meshilemoti, ea Yehisikiya bea Shalumu, ea Amasa bea Hadilayi ak gwasheang'nyi sea fuga leabu ng'ucheeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwayeesha, “Majayeani hiji giing'oonyanga aba gideaba googasayi oohaageasa ramaseanda aba badayda NG'UTAMIIDA gaguuyi sea riing'eega ea giidiinyeanyeeka ghamneawa sindeawi. Aba gideaba ramaseanyeekaasa goola gwaheedu, nea nyarasta ng'waan gwanda badahuuka fuga Israeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasiksa shirikara giing'oonyanga gaweay ea easanga aba madeeda fuga hees ea fuga bwat geat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eatng'eat fugiga sirugu gheawunga nyaawaan ghang'eatng'eat ak gageanda giing'oonyanga ea easanga nyaawa ak gookwealsa hang'weaka fugiga sean dawiiriin aba jeenyaawa, ak gookwealsheesa, ak ghoadaw geeka, ak ghoadaw hamita ea beega, ak ghoamwaar, ak ghwanung' ghwasar digeeniga fuga manda uurjeenga, ak geanung' gabiikta heeda fuga duupchi aba Yeriko, mujiineeda miilayga. Aba ng'ata gabiikta saawa Samariya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahasi gamus weeta aba heeda sugoocheanda Ashuru",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aba damandida sugoocheanda was Ahasi goojeaksa sugoocheanda Ashuru gamus weeta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba fuga Edomu nibiikta ghwanaaw ak ghwajoar fuga Yuda, ak ghwaat fuga Yuda ghoah giing'oonyanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga Filisti ea niibita bugusta mujiinajeega Shefela ea Negebu bea Yuda, ak ea nighas Bet-shemeshi, ea Aiyaloni, ea Gederoti, ea Soko, ea gharang'weaka naawa, ea Dimna ea gharang'weakaaschi, ea Gamso ea gharang'weakaaschi; aba ng'ata gooduuwu aba hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA niihiing'da ng'eanyi fuga Yuda aba ng'asheega Ahasi was sugoocheanda Israeli; aba gideaba gwasissa fuga Yuda riing'eeda nea niiw siida miy doabiiwaat aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea sugoocheanda Ashuru was Dilgat-pilneseri gwajaluudayi niny, ak gwasawan niny damanda gwachi jea gwanyaksa niny uurda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba Ahasi gageanda aba jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea dea sugoocheanda ea dea fuga hees, ak ghoadaw gwaadi sugoocheanda Ashuru; ama ng'ata ea moadawa weeta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Riing'eeda Ahasi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwaraanya sawanadeeda hean gwajakta NG'UTAMIIDA muuchi sugoocheanji was Ahasiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwasissa lukghumajeega aseecheeka ng'eanyiida Dameski ghayi joar niny, nea gwayi, “Aba gideaba niweat saawa aseecheeka sugoodiga ng'eanyiida Shaamu, hean eara aniini gaydasissa saawa lukghumajeega ak abeeda gajiidu ghaweadan.” Ak hean ghoah gidahuuyda niny, ea fuga sean bea Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghabwada geat Ahasi dabita gheeda ASEETA ak ghwalajaada bugusuunatka dabita gheeda ASEETA, aba ng'ata ghwarat gidaghuudajeega gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA; ak gwasissa geaw heeda wagiida aba meadajeega sean bea Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba jeemba gilinyoo ea mujiini gil bea Yuda ghwadeas heetiyeada jea eegwariideaysa geediga ng'andidi bea aseecheeka suuk, hean ghwanyareas NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA ghweanigaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
